  "requiredInputs": [
    "Set title to MM.DD for the Friday of the user request week; freeze full date/timezone in runtime/naming.json using scripts/friday_name.py.",
    "Fill product identity and verified facts/evidence.",
    "Copy supplied original photo/logo assets into the job assets directory and set actual pixel sizes.",
    "Confirm Before/After source roles and provenance for structures 01, 04 and 05. Use an AI concept asset only when explicitly authorized; do not claim real product-use records.",
    "Fill all preparedCrop.sourceRectPx values from original source pixels.",
    "Select and verify a local font file/face and native font policy.",
    "Choose each portrait independently from 0\u00b0 front-facing through at most 45\u00b0. Matching Before/After pose or direction is not required. Record selected source panel/crop and visual pose evidence.",
    "Use the latest transparent official beplain logo at top-left on every page; preserve alpha without a white logo box/badge.",
    "Write fresh English copy in every null text slot using references/click-through-copy.md. Reference headlines and ingredient claims are not reusable defaults.",
    "Read references/approved-quality.md and compare all four actual Canva pages to the matching bundled quality references before presentation.",
    "Use click-through-copy.md for one distinct primary appeal per page, and approved-quality.md for larger useful type and short phrases.",
    "This historical four-layout starter is a composition library. For focused-benefit content, use assets/focused-benefit-template.json and set requested page count/order explicitly."
